          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.030:block:10",
          "start": 883
        },
        "quote": "(1) Yield the right-of-way to pedestrians and give an audible signal before overtaking and passing pedestrians; and",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.030:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
