          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.030:block:11",
          "start": 999
        },
        "quote": "(2) Travel at a speed that is reasonable and prudent under existing conditions, except that an operator of an electric-assisted scooter shall not travel at a speed that exceeds 15 miles per hour.",
